{"title":"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Worse_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Worse Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af048069db131cdb8707533a38f8d9d59102bf9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{8\\sqrt{4}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"46\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59f0f4a479f94b7e2ac42ceb3cf69fbb36ed00de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }4\\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }8\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }8\\sqrt{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"410\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/0/af048069db131cdb8707533a38f8d9d59102bf9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{8\\sqrt{4}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"46\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/0872e1c8ad6b01de297a1edf6311c7b77b6e9ae9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{8\\cdot 2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"83\" height=\"32\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/b/55b123a6a3afb8d7ec66aaad34896558837255c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16\\sqrt{16}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"70\" height=\"32\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1bea7a59dc4c7074f641b376340426c563d15931.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{16\\cdot 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/f/0ef565ca8a3ccd6f868934d74f4dbf556f5b0fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{64}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/72018c4224b234db20bdd33a4343170ee495ae69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Worse_Solution\">Worse Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Worse Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>~ Sahan\n</p><p>We solve the general form expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3cae09ba3697f6421053aa3531b64e1964d601fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a\\sqrt{b\\sqrt{c}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"45\" />. Note, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/4/424d5de402446a916dcfea1b75d7b3806764116b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{a\\sqrt{b\\sqrt{c}}}=(a^4b^2c^1)^\\frac{1}{8}\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"43\" />\nThus our answer is, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/23837ddc992819d2722cda055f450a33918d8fe6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(16^4\\cdot8^24^1)^\\frac{1}{8}=16777216^{\\frac{1}{8}}=8\\]\" width=\"235\" height=\"22\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/elN5lYfeKnw\">https://youtu.be/elN5lYfeKnw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ\">https://youtu.be/cY4NYSAD0vQ</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/H0WHiLy1cFg\">https://youtu.be/H0WHiLy1cFg</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8\" title=\"2017 AMC 8\">2017 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2017\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/inde